# The agent image builds from this whole checkout, so anything excluded here never reaches a
# build context or a layer cache. Nothing the Dockerfiles COPY is listed: the agent image takes
# only container/package.json, container/package-lock.json, container/serena.lock and
# container/ensure-runtime-user.sh, and the ComfyUI backend build keeps modules/ in context.
.git
.env
.local
.serena/
.agent-state/
.playwright-cli/
.github/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
*.zip
# Key material must never be one accidental `docker build` away from a published layer digest.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/id_rsa*
